libcst 1.9.0: make the left-recursive expression rules iterative.
Chains of binary operators, attributes and calls parse in linear time instead of quadratic.
1600-link chain: 4505ms -> 44ms (102x). Real 562-file corpus: 14.560s -> 11.912s (-18.2%).
Upstream suite 1160 passed; 562 real files produce identical CSTs. From oss/fix_libcst.py.

